      "topic_id": "OOP_T00_1",
      "learning_objective_id": "OOP_T00_1_LO01",
      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "What is the exact output of the following C++17 program?\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n\nint compute_score(int limit) {\n    int total = 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= limit; ++i) {\n        if (i % 2 == 0) {\n            total += i;\n        } else {\n            total += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return total;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << compute_score(4) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "A",
          "text": "`6`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "B",
          "text": "`8`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "C",
          "text": "`10`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "D",
          "text": "`4`"
        }
      ],
      "correct_option_id": "B",
      "answer_explanation": "The `for` loop runs for `i = 1, 2, 3, 4`. When `i` is even (`i % 2 == 0`), `total` adds `i`; otherwise, the `else` branch adds `1`. Step by step: `i=1` -> `0 + 1 = 1`; `i=2` -> `1 + 2 = 3`; `i=3` -> `3 + 1 = 4`; `i=4` -> `4 + 4 = 8`. `compute_score(4)` returns `8`.",
      "distractor_explanations": {
        "A": "`6` counts only the even branch (`2 + 4 = 6`) and omits the `+ 1` updates in the `else` branch for `i = 1` and `i = 3`.",
        "C": "`10` sums every index (`1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 10`) instead of adding `1` on odd iterations.",
        "D": "`4` adds `1` on each of the four iterations instead of adding `i` when `i` is even."
      },
      "difficulty_estimate": "easy",
      "misconception_tags": [
        "branch_tracing_in_loop",
        "for_loop_bounds"
      ],
      "authorship_type": "AI-assisted team-authored",
      "reference_sources": [
        "https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/if#Branch_selection",
        "https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/for#Explanation",
        "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/functions-cpp?view=msvc-170#function-definitions"
      ],
      "verification_method": "cpp17_compile_and_run",
      "agent_check_status": "passed",
