      "learning_objective_id": "OOP_T00_2_LO02",
      "question_category": "misconception_analysis",
      "stem": "The following C++17 snippet fails to compile on the marked line:\n```cpp\nint main() {\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; ++i) {\n        sum += i;\n    }\n    return sum + i; // Compile error here\n}\n```\nWhy does the compiler reject `return sum + i;`?",
