      "question_id": "Q_OOP_T00_3_05",
      "question_family_id": "QF_OOP_T00_3_F05",
      "concept_id": "OOP_C00",
      "topic_id": "OOP_T00_3",
      "learning_objective_id": "OOP_T00_3_LO02",
      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Given small positive `int` values `total = 7` and `count = 2`, what is the exact output of the following C++17 program?\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    int total = 7;\n    int count = 2;\n    double avg1 = total / count;\n    double avg2 = static_cast<double>(total) / count;\n    std::cout << avg1 << \" \" << avg2 << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "A",
          "text": "`3 3.5`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "B",
          "text": "`3.5 3.5`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "C",
          "text": "`3 3`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "D",
          "text": "`4 3.5`"
        }
      ],
      "correct_option_id": "A",
      "answer_explanation": "In `avg1 = total / count;`, both operands are `int`, so integer division runs first and truncates `7 / 2` toward zero to `int` `3`, which is then converted to `double` `3.0` (printed as `3`). In `avg2 = static_cast<double>(total) / count;`, the left operand is `double` (`7.0`), so usual arithmetic conversions convert `count` (`2`) to `double` (`2.0`) and floating-point division produces `3.5`.",
      "distractor_explanations": {
        "B": "`3.5 3.5` wrongly assumes assigning to a `double` variable (`avg1`) causes `total / count` to use floating-point division.",
        "C": "`3 3` overlooks that `static_cast<double>(total)` turns the `/` into floating-point division by converting `count` to `double`.",
        "D": "`4 3.5` wrongly assumes integer division rounds `3.5` up to `4` instead of truncating toward zero to `3`."
      },
      "difficulty_estimate": "easy",
      "misconception_tags": [
        "integer_vs_floating_division",
        "usual_arithmetic_conversions"
      ],
      "authorship_type": "AI-assisted team-authored",
      "reference_sources": [
        "https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/operator_arithmetic#Built-in_multiplicative_operators",
        "https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/usual_arithmetic_conversions#Stage_4"
      ],
      "verification_method": "cpp17_compile_and_run",
      "agent_check_status": "passed",
      "human_review_status": "pending",
      "approved_by": null,
      "approved_at": null,
