      "learning_objective_id": "OOP_T01_1_LO02",
      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "What is the exact output of the following C++17 program?\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n\nclass Wallet {\npublic:\n    int cash;\n    int coins;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Wallet a{50, 10};\n    Wallet b{20, 30};\n    Wallet temp = a;\n    a.cash = b.cash + 5;\n    b.coins -= temp.coins;\n    a.coins += b.coins;\n    std::cout << a.cash << \" \" << a.coins << \" | \"\n              << b.cash << \" \" << b.coins << \" | \"\n              << temp.cash << \" \" << temp.coins << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "A",
          "text": "`25 30 | 25 20 | 25 10`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "B",
          "text": "`25 30 | 20 20 | 50 10`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "C",
          "text": "`25 40 | 20 30 | 50 10`"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "D",
          "text": "`55 30 | 20 20 | 50 10`"
        }
      ],
      "correct_option_id": "B",
      "answer_explanation": "`a` starts as `{50, 10}`, `b` as `{20, 30}`, and `Wallet temp = a;` copies `a`'s values into a third independent object `temp` (`{50, 10}`). Then: (1) `a.cash = b.cash + 5` sets `a.cash = 20 + 5 = 25` (`temp.cash` stays `50`); (2) `b.coins -= temp.coins` sets `b.coins = 30 - 10 = 20`; (3) `a.coins += b.coins` sets `a.coins = 10 + 20 = 30`. Thus the program prints `25 30 | 20 20 | 50 10`.",
      "distractor_explanations": {
        "A": "`25 30 | 25 20 | 25 10` wrongly assumes `temp` and `b.cash` alias `a.cash` when `a.cash` becomes `25`.",
        "C": "`25 40 | 20 30 | 50 10` forgets `b.coins -= temp.coins` (`30 - 10 = 20`), keeping `b.coins` at `30` and computing `a.coins = 10 + 30 = 40`.",
        "D": "`55 30 | 20 20 | 50 10` misreads `a.cash = b.cash + 5` as `a.cash += 5` (`50 + 5 = 55`)."
      },
      "difficulty_estimate": "medium",
      "misconception_tags": [
        "object_copy_vs_alias",
        "independent_object_state"
      ],
      "authorship_type": "AI-assisted team-authored",
      "reference_sources": [
        "https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/data_members#Layout",
        "https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/aggregate_initialization#Explanation"
      ],
      "verification_method": "cpp17_compile_and_run",
