      "question_category": "concept_recognition",
      "stem": "Consider the following C++17 class definition:\n```cpp\nclass VolumeControl {\nprivate:\n    int level_ = 50;\npublic:\n    void mute() { level_ = 0; }\n    int level() const { return level_; }\n};\n```\nWhich members of `VolumeControl` may client code in `main()` access directly through an object `VolumeControl vc;`?",
