      "answer_explanation": "`reset_pin()` is declared after the `private:` specifier, so it is a `private` member function and cannot be called by client code in `main()`. Lines 1–3 all compile cleanly: `box` initializes via default member initializers, `unlocked` and `check()` follow `public:`, and `check()` is a member of `Locker` so it may read `pin_`.",
