      "stem": "What is the exact output of the following C++17 program?\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n\nclass Marker {\nprivate:\n    int id_;\npublic:\n    Marker(int id) : id_(id) { std::cout << \"C\" << id_ << \" \"; }\n    ~Marker() { std::cout << \"D\" << id_ << (id_ == 1 ? \"\" : \" \"); }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Marker m1(1);\n    {\n        Marker m2(2);\n        std::cout << \"mid \";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"end \";\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
