      "question_category": "concept_recognition",
      "stem": "Read the following class diagram together with its supplied notation legend:\n```text\n+--------------------+  1   ◆----------- 1..*  +--------------------+\n|      Document      |------------------------>|      Section       |\n+--------------------+                         +--------------------+\n| - title : string   |                         | - heading : string |\n+--------------------+                         +--------------------+\n| + export_pdf()     |                         | + word_count()     |\n+--------------------+                         +--------------------+\n\nLegend:\n  ◆---  Composition (owner at diamond end manages lifetime of part)\n  --->  Navigable direction (source can locate target)\n  - / + Visibility in attribute (middle) and operation (bottom) compartments\n  1, 1..* Multiplicity at that role end (exactly one, one or more)\n```\nBased strictly on this diagram and legend, which statement is accurate?",
