      "stem": "Assume the temporary directory is available, no other process changes the chosen file, and all shown filesystem and stream operations succeed except the intentionally missing-file open (if any).\n\nIn the C++17 program below, the file initially contains `\"alpha\\n\"`. What is the exact output printed to `std::cout`?\n```cpp\n#include <filesystem>\n#include <fstream>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    std::filesystem::path p = std::filesystem::temp_directory_path() / \"oop_t06_1_q6.txt\";\n    {\n        std::ofstream init(p);\n        init << \"alpha\\n\";\n    }\n    {\n        std::ofstream add(p, std::ios::app);\n        add << \"beta\\n\";\n    }\n    std::ifstream in(p);\n    std::string a;\n    std::string b;\n    std::getline(in, a);\n    std::getline(in, b);\n    std::cout << a << \"|\" << b << \"\\n\";\n    in.close();\n    std::filesystem::remove(p);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
