      "learning_objective_id": "OOP_T07_1_LO02",
      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "`std::cout << value` prints a value when the selected type supports this operation. For the shown `int` and `double` arguments, what output line is printed?\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\ntemplate<typename T> void show(T value) { std::cout << value; }\nint main() { show(8); std::cout << \" \"; show(1.5); std::cout << \"\\n\"; }\n```",
