      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Trace the C++17 program below.\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n\ntemplate <class T>\nstruct Holder {\n    T item;\n    T get() const { return item; }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Holder<int> h{9};\n    Holder<double> g{9};\n    std::cout << h.get() / 2 << \" \" << g.get() / 2 << \"\\n\";\n}\n```\nWhat does it print?",
