        "A": "Copying only duplicates an object; it does not define arithmetic, so `a + b` still has no matching operator for `Token` and the compiler reports an error.",
        "B": "A class template instantiates only the members that the program uses; merely declaring `Adder<Token> tokens;` does not instantiate `add`, so the error appears only at the call.",
