      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Consider the following C++17 program:\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nstruct ScopeLog {\n    std::string& log;\n    explicit ScopeLog(std::string& s) : log(s) {}\n    ~ScopeLog() { log += \"D\"; }\n};\n\nvoid work(std::string& log) {\n    ScopeLog guard(log);\n    throw 1;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::string out;\n    try {\n        work(out);\n    } catch (int) {\n        out += \"C\";\n    }\n    std::cout << out << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n```\nWhat does this program print?",
