      "question_category": "misconception_analysis",
      "stem": "A `Badge` struct stores only `int width` and `std::string label`. You copy `badge2` from `badge1` (where `badge1.width == 4`) and then set `badge2.width = 8`. What happens to `badge1.width`?",
