      "topic_id": "OOP_T10_2",
      "learning_objective_id": "OOP_T10_2_LO02",
      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Trace the following C++17 snippet that copies a `Point` exemplar using the implicitly-defined copy constructor:\n```cpp\n#include <iostream>\n\nstruct Point {\n    int x;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Point pt1{2};\n    Point pt2 = pt1;\n    pt2.x = 9;\n    std::cout << pt1.x << \" \" << pt2.x << \"\\n\";\n}\n```\nWhat values are printed by `std::cout`?",
