      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Compare these independent fragments. C++17 uses the compiler-generated copy for this simple `Box`; Java 21 class variables hold references. What are the final values of `a.n`?\n```cpp\nstruct Box { int n; };\nBox a{2}; Box b = a; b.n = 7;\n```\n```java\nclass Box { int n = 2; }\nBox a = new Box(); Box b = a; b.n = 7;\n```",
